AltoDaoMintMarket::borrow()
└── given valid inputs
    ├── when totalBorrowed assets is less than or equal to totalSupply assets
    │   └── when opening fee is greater than 0
    │       └── it should apply borrow opening fee
    ├── given caller is not authorized
    │   └── given caller is not owner
    │       ├── given public access is not enabled
    │       │   └── it should revert
    │       └── given public access is enabled
    │           └── it should succeed
    └── given caller is owner
        └── it should succeed